<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-SPX Corp upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-SPX Corp upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Barrington Research Associates Inc said Thursday it upgraded SPX Corp to a buy rating, expecting the company to outperform the market in the near and long term.</p>
<p>- Analyst Alexander Paris said the SPX's sale of its Sealed Power business is another step to streamline the company and raise shareholder value.</p>
<p>- Paris said there is a possibility of more divestitures, acquisitions and joint ventures before the end of the year.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
